category: Libs
requires: 
sdesc: "Fast and portable library offering functionality for doing package management in a Gentoo system (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "LibPortage is a fast and portable library offering functionality for doing
package management in a Gentoo system. This includes ebuilds, binpkgs and
managing a portage-compatible configuration. The library will provide all the
functions one may need to write a drop-in replacement for Portage in C."

